/* —— What's new, version by version —— */
"With the tabs down the side, the page sits in the window as a card, a little apart from the column." = "标签页在侧边时，页面像卡片一样落在窗口里，与侧边栏略留间距。";
"Split View: two tabs side by side. Drag a tab to the left or right edge of a page, choose Open in Split View in its menu, or press ⌥⌘N." = "分屏浏览：两个标签页并排。把标签页拖到页面的左边缘或右边缘，或在其菜单里选「在分屏浏览中打开」，或按 ⌥⌘N。";
"Pinned rows, as in Arc: a pin can be a row with its name, under the squares, and Clear closes the tabs below." = "固定行，如同 Arc：固定项可以是方格下方一个带名字的行，而「清除」会关闭其下方的标签页。";
"Websites can send notifications and ask for your location, as in Safari, site by site." = "网站可以发送通知、询问你的位置，如同 Safari，逐个网站授权。";
"Loom and other screen recorders work: macOS asks what to share each time, and a pill says who is recording, with Stop." = "Loom 等录屏扩展可以用了：macOS 每次都会问要共享什么，底部的小药丸会显示谁在录制，并带「停止」。";
"Search a site straight from the address field, as in Arc: type its name, then Tab." = "直接在地址栏搜索某个网站，如同 Arc：输入网站名，再按 Tab。";
"Passkeys show under the sign-in field, beside your saved passwords." = "通行密钥显示在登录框下方，与你保存的密码并列。";
"Sign-ins that ask for your name first, or for a password alone, offer your saved accounts too." = "先问用户名、或只问密码的登录，也会列出你保存的账号。";
"Your Mac's text replacements work in pages, and Edit › Substitutions turns them, smart quotes and smart dashes on or off." = "你 Mac 的文本替换在网页里也能用了；「编辑 › 替换」可以开关它，以及智能引号和智能破折号。";
"Find says “3 of 17”, paints every match, and can match case or whole words." = "查找会显示「第 3 项，共 17 项」，标出所有匹配，并可区分大小写或全字匹配。";
"Downloads pause and resume." = "下载可以暂停和继续。";
"Open Link in New Tab leaves you where you are; hold ⌥ to go to it." = "「在新标签页中打开链接」不会把你带走；按住 ⌥ 才会前往。";
"Aura can start with a fresh window: your pinned tabs, tab groups and named tabs, and none of last time's others." = "Aura 可以以全新窗口启动：固定标签页、标签页组和命名过的标签页都在，上次的其他标签页不在。";
"Intel Macs get a download of their own." = "Intel Mac 有了单独的下载版本。";
"Aura is built for size, so all of this fits in 6.8 MB, and pages that change all the time, like a chat writing its answer, stay quick." = "Aura 为体积而设计，所以这一切都装进 6.8 MB，而不断变化的页面（比如正在写答案的对话）依然流畅。";
"An extension's popup window opens as a small window, as in Chrome: a password manager's vault, a sign-in." = "扩展的弹出窗口会以小窗口打开，如同 Chrome：密码管理器的保险库、登录页面。";
"Esc closes a new tab you haven't used, and words typed into a new tab wait for you." = "Esc 会关闭你还没用过的新标签页；在新标签页里输入的文字会为你留着。";
"Tampermonkey installs scripts from a link, and SingleFile saves pages again." = "Tampermonkey 可以从链接安装脚本，SingleFile 也能再次保存页面了。";
"Close Group in a tab group's menu, and one ⇧⌘T brings the whole group back." = "标签页组菜单里的「关闭分组」，一次 ⇧⌘T 就能整组找回。";
"Don't Float Videos Here, in a site's card." = "网站卡片里的「不要在此浮动视频」。";
"Bringing Arc over keeps its shape: pinned pages as pinned rows, its folders as named tab groups." = "从 Arc 导入会保留它的形状：固定的页面成为固定行，它的文件夹成为有名字的标签页组。";
"Too many pinned extensions no longer push the column off screen." = "固定太多扩展也不会再把侧边栏挤出屏幕。";
"Empty a bookmark's name and it is its icon alone on the bookmarks bar." = "清空书签的名字，它在书签栏上就只剩图标。";
"A live video, on X and elsewhere, no longer jumps every few seconds." = "X 等网站上的直播视频不再每隔几秒跳一下。";
"A site's icon follows the page: GitHub's in the dark, a chat's unread count, and each port of localhost its own." = "网站图标跟随页面：GitHub 的深色图标、聊天的未读数，以及 localhost 每个端口各自的图标。";
"Pins brought over from Arc wear their icons straight away." = "从 Arc 导入的固定项马上就有图标。";
"The tabs come back after a video's full screen." = "视频全屏结束后，标签页会回来。";
"A folder in the bookmarks list opens whole." = "书签列表里的文件夹会完整展开。";
"Signing in with a passkey works on GitHub again." = "GitHub 上用通行密钥登录恢复可用。";
"Bitwarden's passkey window, its sync and its narrow popup." = "Bitwarden 的通行密钥窗口、同步以及它那个窄弹窗。";
"Keys in games no longer make the Mac beep." = "在游戏里按键不再让 Mac 发出提示音。";
"History keeps localhost:3000 and localhost:4000 apart." = "历史记录会区分 localhost:3000 和 localhost:4000。";
"Copy Image works on WhatsApp Web's photos." = "「拷贝图像」在 WhatsApp 网页版的照片上可用。";
"Signing in to Claude's extension finishes on claude.ai." = "Claude 扩展的登录会在 claude.ai 上完成。";
"The Bookmarks menu keeps its bookmarks while a tab's title keeps changing." = "标签页标题不停变化时，书签菜单也不会丢失书签。";
"Popovers keep their rounded corners on macOS 15." = "在 macOS 15 上，浮出窗口保持圆角。";
"Security hardening from a third careful private report, and many smaller fixes." = "来自第三份细致的安全报告的安全加固，以及许多更小的修复。";
"Several windows. ⌘N opens one with its own tabs; drag a tab out of the row, or use Move to Window in its menu, and it moves with its page as it is. Pinned tabs are the same in every window." = "多窗口。⌘N 打开一个带自己标签页的窗口；把标签页拖出整行，或用其菜单里的「移到窗口」，它会带着页面原样过去。固定标签页在每个窗口里都一样。";
"Tab groups, and a sidebar on the right." = "标签页组，以及可以放在右侧的侧边栏。";
"Your own keyboard shortcuts, in Settings › Shortcuts." = "你自己的键盘快捷键，在「设置 › 快捷键」里。";
"Downloads show while they happen: a small circle fills beside the other buttons, and the Finder and the Dock show the progress too. The button can stay there for good." = "下载进行中就有显示：其他按钮旁有个小圆圈逐渐填满，访达和程序坞也会显示进度。按钮可以一直留在那里。";
"Bring things over from Firefox, Zen, Helium, Comet, Opera, Chrome's other channels and Arc, its spaces and pinned tabs included, or from an exported file." = "可以从 Firefox、Zen、Helium、Comet、Opera、Chrome 的其他版本以及 Arc（含其空间与固定标签页）导入，或从导出的文件导入。";
"Site shortcuts: a word of your own before a search sends it to that site, like yt cats to YouTube." = "网站快捷搜索：在搜索前加一个自己的词，就送到那个网站，比如 yt cats 送到 YouTube。";
"Bookmarks in the order you choose, folders of your own, and a card to name a bookmark as you add it." = "书签按你定的顺序排列，可以有自己的文件夹，添加时还有一张卡片可以为它命名。";
"Videos can wait for a click, and every site can start at a zoom of your choice." = "视频可以等你点击再播放，每个网站都可以按你选的缩放比例开始。";
"A double-click on a pinned tab takes it back to the page it was pinned at." = "双击固定标签页，会回到当初固定的那个页面。";
"Hold a back or forward swipe to pick a page from history." = "按住向前或向后的轻扫，从历史记录里挑一个页面。";
"Scrolling asks far less of the window, and a tab still loading no longer keeps the Mac busy." = "滚动对窗口的负担小得多，仍在载入的标签页也不再占着 Mac。";
"Where links go, peeking at a link with a shift-click, and flicking the floating video to a corner are now on." = "「显示链接去向」、Shift-点击预览链接、把浮动视频甩到角落，现在都已开启。";
"Tab managers and other extensions see every tab, in every window." = "标签页管理器等扩展能看到每个窗口里的每个标签页。";
"Window › Move & Resize and the Mac's tiling work with Aura's window." = "「窗口 › 移动与调整大小」以及 Mac 的窗口平铺都能作用于 Aura 的窗口。";
"Links from Notion and other apps bring Aura to the front." = "来自 Notion 等 App 的链接会把 Aura 带到前台。";
"Addresses a dev server prints, like 0.0.0.0:3000, open." = "开发服务器打印的地址（如 0.0.0.0:3000）可以打开了。";
"The tabs you had at quit are the ones that come back." = "退出时有哪些标签页，回来还是哪些。";
"The × closes a tab in the tab bar folded away with ⌘S." = "用 ⌘S 收起的标签栏里，× 也能关闭标签页。";
"And many smaller fixes." = "以及许多更小的修复。";
"Copying a saved password asks for Touch ID." = "拷贝保存的密码需要 Touch ID。";
"A mouse wheel scrolls smoothly again on x.com and pages like it." = "在 x.com 及类似的页面上，鼠标滚轮又能顺畅滚动了。";
"History opens at once." = "历史记录可以立刻打开。";
"Music keeps playing when you switch spaces." = "切换空间时音乐继续播放。";
"Pop-ups need a click." = "弹出窗口需要点击才会打开。";
"The holes found in this week's reviews: an extension could read files outside its own folder, and a page or an ad could open another app without asking." = "本周审查发现的漏洞：扩展可以读取其文件夹之外的文件，网页或广告可以在不经询问的情况下打开其他 App。";
"Bitwarden signs in to a self-hosted server, and extension popups hear what changes while they're open." = "Bitwarden 可以登录自建服务器，扩展弹窗在打开期间也能收到变化。";
"A link from Mail brings Aura to the front, and a full-screen video no longer goes black." = "来自「邮件」的链接会把 Aura 带到前台，全屏视频也不再黑屏。";
"Your extensions may each ask once more for their permissions at their next update." = "你的扩展在下一次更新时可能各自再请求一次权限。";
"A site's passkey button brings up the Mac's own passkey sheet: Touch ID, your iPhone, a security key." = "网站的通行密钥按钮会唤起 Mac 自己的通行密钥面板：Touch ID、你的 iPhone、安全密钥。";
"Aura can be the Mac's default browser." = "Aura 可以成为这台 Mac 的默认浏览器。";
"Each off until you turn it on in Settings: a bookmarks bar, a peek at a link with a shift-click, the video that follows you to another app, pages at 120 Hz, and where a link goes." = "以下各项在设置里开启之前都是关闭的：书签栏、Shift-点击预览链接、跟着你到其他 App 的视频、网页 120 Hz 刷新，以及链接去向提示。";
"Mute a tab, share a page, copy a link as Markdown, the mouse's back and forward buttons, and spaces in the bar across the top." = "静音标签页、共享页面、把链接拷贝为 Markdown、鼠标的前进后退键，以及顶部标签栏里的空间。";
"Faster to open, and new tabs in about 10 ms." = "打开更快，新标签页约 10 毫秒。";
"Pages see nothing of Aura that Safari doesn't show them, and a saved password is offered only on its own site." = "网页看不到任何 Safari 不会显示的东西，保存的密码也只在它自己的网站上提供。";
"If passkeys still fail after the update, restart your Mac once." = "如果更新后通行密钥仍然失败，请重启一次 Mac。";
"Each off until you turn it on in Settings: Spaces, a sidebar that hides until the pointer reaches the edge, and the search engine of your choice." = "以下各项在设置里开启之前都是关闭的：空间、指针到达边缘才出现的侧边栏，以及你选择的搜索引擎。";
"Aura opens again on macOS 14." = "Aura 在 macOS 14 上重新可以打开了。";
"Signing in to Google no longer reloads the page over and over with iCloud Passwords installed." = "装了 iCloud 密码之后，登录 Google 不再反复刷新页面。";
"Tabs in a row or down the side, pinned tabs that keep their place, and one field for addresses and searches." = "标签页排成一行或放在侧边，固定标签页始终在原位，一个输入框兼顾地址与搜索。";
"Ads blocked before they load; passwords and passkeys in your keychain." = "广告在载入之前就被拦截；密码和通行密钥保存在你的钥匙串里。";
"Anything on a page can be hidden; articles open in a reading mode and videos float." = "页面上任何内容都能隐藏；文章以阅读模式打开，视频可以浮动。";
"Chrome extensions from the Chrome Web Store, on macOS 15.4 or later." = "在 macOS 15.4 或更高版本上，可以从 Chrome 应用商店安装 Chrome 扩展。";
"Tabs you haven't looked at for half an hour sleep and give their memory back." = "半小时没看的标签页会休眠，把内存还回来。";
"It runs on the engine already in macOS and weighs 2.9 MB." = "它运行在 macOS 已有的引擎上，体积只有 2.9 MB。";
